We ran one hundred twenty-three synthetic
graphs with runtime optimizations

4
00:00:15,258 --> 00:00:20,383
off and on. Two hundred thirty-two
evaluations passed. Fourteen divergences

5
00:00:20,383 --> 00:00:22,433
